            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.webm?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dispara contra os teus amigos </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Senta-te à mesa do novo modo multijogador até 4 jogadores. Negoceia. Implora. Trai. Torna-te o derradeiro vencedor. Sai de lá rico.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.webm?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ação de calibre 12</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Joga roleta russa com uma arma calibre 12. Porque com uma espingarda, tudo fica melhor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.webm?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay literalmente de perder a cabeça</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cada partida tem de 15 a 20 minutos de jogo intenso. Entra na arena, joga três rondas contra o Dealer e sai com o prêmio. Ou não.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.webm?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosfera imersiva</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boas-vindas a uma discoteca do submundo, onde grades de metal pulsam ao som de velhas baterias eletrônicas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.webm?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confronta o teu rival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enfrenta o Dealer, que joga com as mesmas probabilidades que tu. Sem truques. Será que podes vencê-lo no seu próprio jogo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.webm?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >O dobro ou nada</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tente a sorte no novo modo &quot;O dobro ou nada&quot;. Quanto tempo aguentas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.webm?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Novos itens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Novos itens para o lançamento do Steam. Só para mostrar o quanto te adoramos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.webm?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sete pistas. Nada de erros. Aguentas?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A edição do Steam de Buckshot Roulette também inclui a banda sonora completa, criada por Mike Klubnika.</p>",
